WEBVTT

00:08.875 --> 00:16.916
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.916 --> 00:24.914
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.432 --> 00:36.236
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.236 --> 00:39.239
Believing, dreaming

00:39.239 --> 00:43.076
We are searching

00:43.076 --> 00:48.207
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:50.016 --> 00:58.425
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.425 --> 01:02.996
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.996 --> 01:05.665
Ah, surely someday

01:05.665 --> 01:13.940
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.940 --> 01:18.900
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.447 --> 01:27.080
Let's begin our journey

02:07.760 --> 02:10.388
You enjoy making mischief,
don't you, big sister?

02:10.730 --> 02:13.358
This is an order from Lord Odin.

02:13.933 --> 02:16.094
Fate is harsh, isn't it?

02:27.213 --> 02:32.845
The 13th Night
Fantastic Flower

02:40.026 --> 02:43.655
I'm glad you could find what
you were looking for.

02:43.863 --> 02:44.931
Yes!

02:44.931 --> 02:47.593
Um, Loki?

02:47.967 --> 02:49.369
What is it?

02:49.369 --> 02:52.805
Thanks for coming shopping with me.

02:52.805 --> 02:55.475
I haven't had any cases lately,
so I've got plenty of free time.

02:55.475 --> 02:57.875
It's nothing to thank me for.

03:07.654 --> 03:10.020
This is kind of like a date!

03:22.435 --> 03:25.666
Handy, isn't it?
I bought it through mail order.

03:26.673 --> 03:30.973
For a limited time, it's buy one,
get one free. Imagine that!

03:32.478 --> 03:34.173
Well, I'd appreciate a little help here.

03:48.494 --> 03:52.954
I know! This time I'll clean the
storage room for a change.

03:58.238 --> 04:01.696
It's a downy rose myrtle.
Did we even have one of these?

04:03.042 --> 04:04.873
Maybe it's Master Loki's.

04:10.950 --> 04:11.951
One vanilla, please.

04:11.951 --> 04:13.248
Go, Taro!
Yes, ma'am!

04:15.288 --> 04:18.558
This is so good! It's so relaxing!

04:18.558 --> 04:20.793
Well, you did do a lot of walking today.

04:20.793 --> 04:23.229
You need to keep your energy up.

04:23.229 --> 04:25.765
Um, Loki?

04:25.765 --> 04:29.435
If you don't mind, there's one
more place I'd like to go to.

04:29.435 --> 04:30.402
Huh?
If you don't mind, there's one
more place I'd like to go to.

04:31.304 --> 04:32.430
Loki!

04:32.772 --> 04:33.864
Oh!

04:45.351 --> 04:47.319
It's down here.

04:52.058 --> 04:53.184
Good afternoon!

04:55.228 --> 04:56.525
Yamino?

04:56.896 --> 05:00.525
Ow... Ooh, that hurts.

05:01.434 --> 05:02.435
Huh?

05:02.435 --> 05:04.937
What am I doing...

05:04.937 --> 05:06.234
Yeow!

05:08.107 --> 05:10.735
Wasn't this flower in the foyer earlier?

05:11.444 --> 05:12.911
Yamino?

05:13.880 --> 05:16.678
I heard an awful crash. Are you all right?

05:17.116 --> 05:18.318
Mayura?

05:18.318 --> 05:20.320
I'm coming down there now.

05:20.320 --> 05:22.221
I can't let her see this place!

05:22.221 --> 05:24.223
Wow, this is one dark stairwell!

05:24.223 --> 05:26.259
I smell a mystery!

05:26.259 --> 05:28.828
She's coming! Uh, Mayura!

05:28.828 --> 05:33.032
I'm all right! I'm coming now,
so just stay where you are.

05:33.032 --> 05:35.227
Huh? Oh, come on!

05:53.820 --> 05:56.189
So you got more birdcages?

05:56.189 --> 05:57.423
That's right.

05:57.423 --> 06:02.383
But now we're really busy because we have
to set up more fences and feeders!

06:03.663 --> 06:05.290
Sounds like you're having fun, though.

06:05.732 --> 06:07.757
You can tell, huh?

06:09.435 --> 06:11.104
Oh well, I have to be going.

06:11.104 --> 06:13.206
We have a whole bunch of
rare birds that came in,

06:13.206 --> 06:14.941
so stop by when you have the chance!

06:14.941 --> 06:17.443
Okay. I'll drop by sometime soon.

06:17.443 --> 06:18.603
See you!

06:19.912 --> 06:22.582
That was one of my former clients.

06:22.582 --> 06:24.948
She takes care of the birds at the local z...

06:27.453 --> 06:28.613
Reiya?

06:31.324 --> 06:32.222
Reiya!

06:56.349 --> 06:57.976
I'm sorry.

07:02.488 --> 07:03.990
Why'd you do that?

07:03.990 --> 07:05.787
I'm sorry.

07:08.227 --> 07:10.627
I was starting to feel lonely.

07:11.964 --> 07:17.163
For some reason I felt really
sad and lonely.

07:18.304 --> 07:23.173
But I thought I shouldn't let
you see me like that.

07:24.677 --> 07:25.974
Reiya...

07:28.314 --> 07:31.150
I didn't know what to do.

07:31.150 --> 07:33.948
I felt a stinging pain in my heart.

07:34.387 --> 07:37.515
Because I...

07:38.257 --> 07:41.385
Because, Loki, I...

08:04.150 --> 08:05.344
Freya!

08:09.188 --> 08:10.155
Loki.

08:21.167 --> 08:22.464
You're...

08:23.169 --> 08:27.128
I no longer have any need for
the Brising necklace.

08:27.974 --> 08:33.310
The sadness of being ignored by you
has awakened me at last.

08:34.313 --> 08:37.441
Even now, I feel such sadness
deep within my heart.

08:40.586 --> 08:43.146
Can you hear my heart, Loki?

08:53.432 --> 08:55.229
It's so lonely.

08:57.937 --> 09:01.065
Do you hear the voice of my
anguished heart as it cries?

09:07.079 --> 09:10.783
Please, Loki. Love me.

09:10.783 --> 09:14.742
That is what I wish to have.

09:23.429 --> 09:25.056
I love you.

09:28.234 --> 09:30.725
I love you, Loki.

09:44.283 --> 09:48.054
There! You see, Gullinbursti?

09:48.054 --> 09:50.921
This isn't the seaside park after all!

09:51.857 --> 09:55.962
I was all set to spend the evening at the
beach, reminiscing about my sister.

09:55.962 --> 09:58.590
Reflect deeply on what you've done!
And by "deep" I mean deeper than the ocean!

10:00.499 --> 10:04.731
I can't wait any longer! I want to hear
that cheerful voice of hers!

10:05.304 --> 10:06.572
Big brother!

10:06.572 --> 10:08.841
Yes! Just like that!

10:08.841 --> 10:11.177
Her cheerful voice calling, "Big brother!"

10:11.177 --> 10:13.846
Look at what you've done! Good grief!

10:13.846 --> 10:16.916
Yeah! Or sounding really angry and yelling,

10:16.916 --> 10:19.885
"Look at what you've done! Good grief!"

10:20.620 --> 10:21.587
Huh?

10:24.790 --> 10:27.088
A superb illusion.

10:27.259 --> 10:28.886
Why, it looks just like her!

10:31.831 --> 10:33.666
It really is me!

10:33.666 --> 10:35.224
What?

10:35.701 --> 10:37.036
Are you real?

10:37.036 --> 10:39.305
And by "real" I mean, "for really real"?!

10:39.305 --> 10:42.341
What is that nonsense supposed to mean?

10:42.341 --> 10:45.444
I almost had Loki! I was so close!

10:45.444 --> 10:46.445
What?

10:46.445 --> 10:48.242
Loki! Where are you?!

10:49.081 --> 10:51.684
He's gone! Loki's gone!

10:51.684 --> 10:53.152
Well anyhow...

10:53.152 --> 10:55.755
Oh, my beloved little sister, Freya!

10:55.755 --> 10:57.814
At last we meet again!

10:58.157 --> 11:02.161
Come, let big brother express his
emotions with a nice, big hug!

11:02.161 --> 11:03.492
Loki!

11:06.732 --> 11:09.902
Little Freya is quite energetic, I see.

11:09.902 --> 11:12.598
This is truly a relief for me.

11:13.906 --> 11:15.601
Ow, the rim really hurts.

11:22.548 --> 11:27.008
If you can't have it unless you
pursue it, then pursue it I will!

11:28.254 --> 11:30.722
You can't have it unless you pursue it?

11:33.526 --> 11:35.494
Does that apply to me, too?

11:36.095 --> 11:39.553
Ah, perhaps it does. My desire to return
to the world of the gods, for instance.

11:46.138 --> 11:47.605
This is...

12:00.920 --> 12:02.421
This is...

12:02.421 --> 12:03.888
No, it couldn't be!

12:55.674 --> 12:57.665
Sorry for the wait!

12:58.277 --> 13:01.007
We hope to see you again
at Dum-dum Donuts!

13:02.348 --> 13:04.316
One cinnamon ring, please.

13:04.316 --> 13:05.613
Welcome, sir!

13:06.185 --> 13:08.983
These items are now all 30% off...

13:10.689 --> 13:11.986
It's you!

13:14.360 --> 13:16.362
Hey there, Narugami.

13:16.362 --> 13:18.159
You're working hard, aren't you?

13:18.531 --> 13:18.764
Okonomiyaki
Monja

13:18.764 --> 13:20.733
Okonomiyaki
Monja
What's going on here?

13:20.733 --> 13:20.766
What's going on here?

13:20.766 --> 13:23.903
Well, it's a long story, but...

13:23.903 --> 13:26.238
Hey, c'mon, don't break the edges!

13:26.238 --> 13:27.466
Oh. Sorry.

13:27.673 --> 13:31.010
Cripes. Talk about an amateur...

13:31.010 --> 13:32.978
Say, don't you feel...

13:34.680 --> 13:37.308
a little uncomfortable being here?

13:39.485 --> 13:41.987
What a hunk!
He's so cool!

13:41.987 --> 13:43.284
Cool!

13:46.792 --> 13:47.793
Not really.

13:47.793 --> 13:50.125
Oh. Okay then.

13:50.496 --> 13:53.624
You probably got this all the time
back in the world of the gods.

13:53.999 --> 13:56.126
Here, it's done. Eat it up quick.

13:56.502 --> 13:58.003
Oh, right.

13:58.003 --> 14:00.506
So anyway, about my changing
back into this form...

14:00.506 --> 14:02.599
We'll get to that later!

14:03.008 --> 14:05.744
You don't want it to burn, do you? Eat it!

14:05.744 --> 14:08.372
Ah. Yeah, you're right.

14:10.482 --> 14:11.483
Odin?

14:11.483 --> 14:12.751
Yeah.

14:12.751 --> 14:15.888
He released all the evil power
that I'd collected.

14:15.888 --> 14:17.856
So that's how you returned
to your original form?

14:17.957 --> 14:18.624
He's so handsome!

14:18.624 --> 14:19.859
He's so handsome!
It's only temporary.

14:19.859 --> 14:21.126
Who is he?
It's only temporary.

14:21.126 --> 14:23.062
What with the amount of evil
power that was there...

14:23.062 --> 14:27.266
But, how did Odin ever find out where
you were keeping the energy?

14:27.266 --> 14:31.170
Search me. But this does
tell me two things.

14:31.170 --> 14:32.797
Two things?

14:33.072 --> 14:37.873
My actions are being carefully watched, and...

14:38.744 --> 14:43.113
He does not want me returning to the
world of the gods, by any means.

14:49.021 --> 14:50.318
Loki...

14:51.523 --> 14:54.193
I don't know what Odin is thinking.

14:54.193 --> 14:56.491
Hey! Where are you going?

14:56.929 --> 14:58.430
Around.

14:58.430 --> 15:00.898
I might as well enjoy this
form while I'm in it.

15:11.443 --> 15:14.810
I think I kind of understand
what Odin's thinking.

15:17.082 --> 15:19.107
Thank you very much!

15:21.287 --> 15:22.788
We got a whole bunch of them!

15:22.788 --> 15:24.813
You really think you can eat all of that?

15:25.124 --> 15:27.684
No problem! I've always got room for cake!

15:30.296 --> 15:35.167
I had no idea this bakery is another
of your family's businesses.

15:35.167 --> 15:37.294
My old man's into all sorts of things.

15:40.539 --> 15:42.166
Oww!

15:43.242 --> 15:44.443
It's Mayura!

15:44.443 --> 15:45.611
Daidoji!

15:45.611 --> 15:48.113
Bozo. This is what happens when you
don't watch where you're going.

15:48.113 --> 15:50.249
Are you all right, Mayura?

15:50.249 --> 15:51.716
Allow me to offer my apolog...

15:54.253 --> 15:56.687
Huh? Oh, uh, right.

15:57.623 --> 16:02.026
Um, don't mind me. It's nothing, really.

16:03.996 --> 16:06.624
Sorry about that. Are you okay?

16:06.865 --> 16:09.663
Uh, yeah. I'm all right.

16:10.336 --> 16:12.804
Come on, Daidoji.
This guy deserves an apolo...

16:14.506 --> 16:17.242
I'm so sorry for running into you.

16:17.242 --> 16:19.278
Uh, no problem.

16:19.278 --> 16:21.803
Well, I'm in kind of a hurry. See you.

16:23.082 --> 16:25.651
Please be sure to explain this to me later!

16:25.651 --> 16:27.152
I know, I know.

16:27.152 --> 16:28.619
No matter what!

16:31.256 --> 16:33.724
I'm lucky that didn't turn into
more trouble than it was.

16:35.861 --> 16:37.162
Hey.

16:37.162 --> 16:39.130
Hey, Daidoji!

16:40.265 --> 16:42.034
He's gone already.

16:42.034 --> 16:43.763
Beautiful!

16:44.003 --> 16:46.028
What's beautiful?

16:46.672 --> 16:48.105
But...

16:48.741 --> 16:51.276
There was something about that guy...

16:51.276 --> 16:54.211
that reminded me of someone I know.

16:54.880 --> 16:56.677
And who is that someone?

16:58.517 --> 16:59.381
Dunno.

16:59.752 --> 17:02.988
Wow, we sure bought a lot of these!

17:02.988 --> 17:06.219
We won't have any need for cup ramen
for quite some time.

17:07.092 --> 17:11.030
You've found your sister now, so get the
heck back to the world of the gods.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.657
Don't be silly!

17:12.931 --> 17:19.803
There's still the super-duper-big matter of
making that Japanese beauty my wife!

17:20.105 --> 17:22.369
Ah, I see. Well, do as you like then.

17:22.741 --> 17:25.539
Oh, I certainly will.

17:25.944 --> 17:27.912
No matter what the odds, I shall succeed.

17:28.714 --> 17:32.384
Just don't ever ask me to come with you on
any of these bargain shopping excursions again.

17:32.384 --> 17:34.987
How can you say that?

17:34.987 --> 17:37.455
It's a waste to go bargain
hunting on your own!

17:38.690 --> 17:40.793
Then find someone else to go with.

17:40.793 --> 17:42.127
What's up, Heimdall?

17:42.127 --> 17:43.195
Hey, Loki.

17:43.195 --> 17:44.890
How are you doing, Loki?

17:49.735 --> 17:51.503
Loki's gone back to his original form!

17:51.503 --> 17:51.904
Oh, my!
Loki's gone back to his original form!

17:51.904 --> 17:53.633
Oh, my!

18:10.756 --> 18:12.451
There's no fooling you, Ecchan.

18:14.726 --> 18:17.062
Huh? Is there somewhere
you want me to go?

18:17.062 --> 18:19.087
Ah, I found you!

18:20.265 --> 18:22.597
And now you're back in your
original form too!

18:22.901 --> 18:25.369
Yeah. Well, a lot has happened.

18:26.038 --> 18:28.407
You look so handsome like that.

18:28.407 --> 18:29.408
Oh!

18:29.408 --> 18:31.273
Loki...

18:46.391 --> 18:49.849
I'm happy you feel that way, Freya.

18:51.997 --> 18:54.795
Yeah, you're right. C'mon, let's go.

19:12.017 --> 19:13.314
Now I see.

19:29.401 --> 19:32.199
So you're the one who released
the evil power?

20:11.476 --> 20:12.841
Loki!

20:13.979 --> 20:16.413
Reiya. You woke up, huh?

20:19.184 --> 20:20.481
Hey, everyone.

20:23.855 --> 20:26.592
All right, time for a quiz!

20:26.592 --> 20:29.861
Only one of these is the "right" box.

20:29.861 --> 20:32.091
Please pick one!

20:33.832 --> 20:34.833
Me?

20:34.833 --> 20:37.631
Yeah. And you get to eat whatever's
inside the box you pick.

20:38.036 --> 20:40.834
Okay then, I'll pick the one
that isn't smashed up.

20:41.406 --> 20:42.274
Shock!

20:42.274 --> 20:43.332
This one.

20:43.675 --> 20:45.302
Looks like the right one.

20:50.382 --> 20:52.618
Hey, tell me, Loki.

20:52.618 --> 20:55.849
How did you know that one
would be smashed?

20:56.421 --> 20:58.423
Because I'm a detective.

20:58.423 --> 21:01.915
You probably got distracted by some
good-looking guy and dropped it, right?

21:03.528 --> 21:05.086
No way!

21:07.866 --> 21:09.834
Mmm. This is good!

21:18.076 --> 21:19.304
Odin...

21:20.545 --> 21:23.343
So what will your next move be?

22:16.935 --> 22:28.904
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.615 --> 22:42.361
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.361 --> 22:49.468
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.468 --> 22:55.907
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:55.907 --> 23:05.417
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.417 --> 23:09.755
Even if we're hurt

23:09.755 --> 23:21.767
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.767 --> 23:23.496
Believe in Heaven

23:31.276 --> 23:32.844
Next Episode

23:32.844 --> 23:36.415
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are,
"puppy," "monster" and "sweet bun."

23:36.415 --> 23:36.982
Next Episode

23:36.982 --> 23:39.351
Next Episode
Ah, it's a puppy! Woof, woof!

23:39.351 --> 23:40.252
Next Episode

23:40.252 --> 23:42.821
Next Episode
I love puppies! Especially black ones!

23:42.821 --> 23:43.622
Next Episode

23:43.622 --> 23:45.791
Next Episode
Little tiny ones like this
are especially good!

23:45.791 --> 23:46.825
Next Episode

23:46.825 --> 23:49.294
Next Episode
And the ones with three eyes
and wings and scales,

23:49.294 --> 23:51.897
Next Episode
and an antenna all stickin' out
on its rear end!

23:51.897 --> 23:52.264
Next Episode

23:52.264 --> 23:53.932
Next Episode
That ain't no dog!

23:53.932 --> 23:54.199
Next Episode

23:54.199 --> 23:55.700
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.700 --> 23:56.134
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.134 --> 23:56.201
"Light Dog, Dark Dog, Black Dog"

23:56.201 --> 23:58.136
The 14th Night
Light Dog, Dark Dog, Black Dog
"Light Dog, Dark Dog, Black Dog"

23:58.136 --> 24:00.005
The 14th Night
Light Dog, Dark Dog, Black Dog
Another strange mystery!

24:00.005 --> 24:01.131
The 14th Night
Light Dog, Dark Dog, Black Dog
